X: 1
T: Suddenly Seymour
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: The Little Shop of Horrors duet. Melody channels (verse ch 4, chorus ch 0)
N: of a hamienet.com MIDI (id 7946), moved up three semitones from A major to C
N: so the range fits the recorder (the final note reaches Bb5, one step over A5
N: but within the fingering charts); chords fitted from the MIDI's accompaniment
N: (doo-wop C7-F7 with D7-G7 lifts). Form: the verse, the two chorus phrases and
N: the final statement, with the empty vamp bars between them compressed out;
N: the triplet pushes and the late pickup are straightened; pitches are the
N: source's. The source ends on the flat seventh over C7.
L: 1/8
Q: 1/4=120
M: 4/4
